WEBVTT - Subtitles by: Nucleon

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:05.008
It was a dark and stormy night...

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.639
Gingy?

00:00:10.806 --> 00:00:13.475
My girlfriend kicked me out.

00:00:14.226 --> 00:00:17.520
You know, something about me
being too into myself.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.817
You? But you are so adorable.

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:24.069
I know, that's what I keep telling her!

00:00:24.236 --> 00:00:26.571
I need a good woman, Muffin Man.

00:00:27.198 --> 00:00:29.241
I can help you, Gingy.

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:30.617
How about this one?

00:00:30.785 --> 00:00:32.536
- I don't know.
- You like her?

00:00:32.703 --> 00:00:34.037
No. Weird hair.

00:00:34.205 --> 00:00:35.956
- How about this one?
- Too skinny.

00:00:36.123 --> 00:00:37.332
No! Don't like it!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.084
OK. Well, how about this one?

00:00:39.251 --> 00:00:40.919
Yes! That's it!

00:00:43.047 --> 00:00:44.840
She's perfect.

00:00:45.007 --> 00:00:46.925
The girl of my dreams.

00:00:49.512 --> 00:00:51.180
Wait. More sugar.

00:00:51.347 --> 00:00:53.098
But that is not the recipe.

00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:56.226
Trust me, Muffin Man,
this girl's gotta be real sweet.

00:00:56.393 --> 00:00:58.686
I want someone
who will love me forever.

00:00:58.854 --> 00:01:00.146
I must warn you, Gingy.

00:01:00.314 --> 00:01:02.733
No one has ever made cookies
with this much sugar.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.528
You are tampering with forces
far beyond your comprehension!

00:01:08.364 --> 00:01:10.157
Just put her in the oven!

00:01:33.097 --> 00:01:34.973
OK, a little privacy?

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.432
Take a hike.

00:01:36.976 --> 00:01:38.978
Oh, oui.

00:01:50.447 --> 00:01:52.198
Oh, my gosh, I'm in love!

00:01:52.366 --> 00:01:54.618
You're like a cookie angel.

00:01:55.119 --> 00:01:57.663
Wow! And you're hot, too!

00:01:58.622 --> 00:02:00.123
Hello?

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:02.626
Hello?

00:02:04.378 --> 00:02:07.047
I guess it didn't work.

00:02:17.766 --> 00:02:19.559
Gingy. Is it you?

00:02:19.727 --> 00:02:22.020
The one I was made for?

00:02:22.187 --> 00:02:24.063
We'll be together forever.

00:02:24.231 --> 00:02:25.732
Sweet!

00:02:56.388 --> 00:02:57.889
Are you happy, Gingy?

00:02:58.057 --> 00:03:00.184
You bet!
The time since I met you

00:03:00.351 --> 00:03:03.354
has been the best...
seven and a half minutes of my life.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.064
Good! Because this is
only the beginning.

00:03:06.231 --> 00:03:08.691
I'm going to love you and hold you,

00:03:08.859 --> 00:03:12.070
and feed you and dress you
and cling to you and...

00:03:12.237 --> 00:03:14.989
...hang onto you and smother you
with my love.

00:03:15.157 --> 00:03:17.325
- Yeah.
- Forever and ever and ever and ever...

00:03:17.493 --> 00:03:20.245
You know,
it's getting a little stuffy in here.

00:03:20.412 --> 00:03:22.539
You know, I'm gonna go get some air.

00:03:22.706 --> 00:03:25.208
- Oh, no, you don't.
- Oh, no!

00:03:25.376 --> 00:03:27.419
Not without your umbrella.

00:03:27.586 --> 00:03:28.545
Come on!

00:03:28.712 --> 00:03:30.213
Here, let me get that.

00:03:30.381 --> 00:03:31.673
Wait for me.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.552
Sugar, could you just do me
one small, little, teeny favor?

00:03:35.719 --> 00:03:36.678
Anything.

00:03:36.845 --> 00:03:38.555
Could you leave me alone
for like 30 seconds?

00:03:38.722 --> 00:03:40.807
Anything but that.

00:03:41.767 --> 00:03:43.727
Yeah, I forgot
my gumdrop buttons. Yeah.

00:03:43.894 --> 00:03:46.313
Could you run over there
and get 'em for me, please?

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:49.191
Sure I can. I'll be right back.
Gingy, Gingy...

00:03:49.358 --> 00:03:51.568
Run, run, run as fast as you can,

00:03:51.735 --> 00:03:54.362
if you want to remain
a gingerbread man!

00:03:59.368 --> 00:04:00.827
Oh, Gingy.

00:04:00.995 --> 00:04:03.831
I don't understand.
I thought you were happy.

00:04:03.998 --> 00:04:06.208
- Oh, well, I...
- It's all my fault.

00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:07.834
I should have tried harder!

00:04:08.002 --> 00:04:09.712
No, no, no! Don't try harder!

00:04:09.878 --> 00:04:11.671
Maybe I'm not pretty enough.

00:04:11.839 --> 00:04:15.008
I can be pretty! Really pretty.

00:04:15.175 --> 00:04:16.593
The girl of your dreams.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:19.637
- Remember?
- Leave me alone!

00:04:19.805 --> 00:04:21.765
Gingy!

00:04:23.517 --> 00:04:25.143
Let go, Gingy!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:29.188
Fall with me,
so we can be together forever!

00:04:29.356 --> 00:04:32.192
Here's a thought. You let go!

00:04:32.359 --> 00:04:35.445
Together. Together for...

00:04:38.115 --> 00:04:39.783
Boy, what a night!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:42.494
I'm so glad that is over with.

00:04:43.203 --> 00:04:45.455
- Oh, well, nothing lasts forever.
- In sports...

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:10.730
Together forever.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.484
Together forever.

00:05:14.651 --> 00:05:16.819
Together forever.

00:05:16.987 --> 00:05:19.489
Together forever.

00:05:19.656 --> 00:05:21.658
- Together forever.
- What a nice surprise.

00:05:21.825 --> 00:05:23.952
Together forever.

00:05:24.119 --> 00:05:26.788
Together forever.

00:05:26.955 --> 00:05:28.665
Together forever.

00:05:28.832 --> 00:05:31.000
Together forever.

00:05:31.168 --> 00:05:33.628
Hey! So, what's up?

00:05:33.796 --> 00:05:37.174
I think we both may have said
some things I might regret.

00:05:37.341 --> 00:05:40.594
- Together forever.
- Gosh, your eye is pretty.

00:05:40.761 --> 00:05:42.971
Look, I know you're upset, so...

00:05:43.138 --> 00:05:47.100
Why don't we just sit down
and discuss this!

00:05:47.267 --> 00:05:49.560
Then they ate me.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.263
Hey, hey. What the...?

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.682
And we needed to find us some shelter.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.727
This is my turn to tell a story.

00:06:02.938 --> 00:06:04.731
Hey, hey.

00:06:04.899 --> 00:06:06.650
The kindly innkeeper
was warm and friendly.

00:06:06.817 --> 00:06:08.485
She made me feel all bubbly inside.

00:06:08.653 --> 00:06:11.447
My trusty sidekick here
would love to freshen up.

00:06:11.614 --> 00:06:13.407
- Sidekick?
- And I would love some waffles.

00:06:13.574 --> 00:06:17.160
- We are equals.
- Oh, man. Of course we are.

00:06:17.328 --> 00:06:19.705
The noble donkey reassured his
clearly inferior sidekick.

00:06:19.872 --> 00:06:21.206
I'm getting a little tired of this.

00:06:21.374 --> 00:06:22.583
But before Puss could finish
his thought,

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:25.586
he decided to take
a well-deserved tongue bath.

00:06:25.753 --> 00:06:27.379
What the...?

00:06:27.546 --> 00:06:29.089
Well, as long as I am here.

00:06:29.256 --> 00:06:31.633
But right then,
danger came from behind.

00:06:37.932 --> 00:06:40.809
And Puss was never seen again.

00:06:41.769 --> 00:06:42.603
The end.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.938
No! That is not how the story goes.

00:06:45.106 --> 00:06:47.191
I was well aware
of the approaching danger

00:06:47.358 --> 00:06:49.735
and went for my steel!

00:06:49.902 --> 00:06:52.279
Don't worry, little buddy.
I'm here to save you.

00:06:52.446 --> 00:06:54.030
Oh, you're killing me.

00:06:54.782 --> 00:06:58.327
It was Prince Charming. He was packing
heat and he wanted revenge!

00:06:58.494 --> 00:07:00.120
- I want revenge!
- He said.

00:07:00.287 --> 00:07:02.247
But before anyone could do anything...

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.376
It was awful and it was terrible
and it was really, really scary.

00:07:06.544 --> 00:07:08.379
What? No! Go back.

00:07:10.089 --> 00:07:11.548
Although the Charming was fast,

00:07:11.716 --> 00:07:14.969
I was swift enough to repel the attack
and leap to safety.

00:07:15.136 --> 00:07:17.721
Which is exactly
what he wanted you to do.

00:07:18.472 --> 00:07:21.141
Charming laughed,
just like a crazed maniac.

00:07:26.772 --> 00:07:30.066
No, I'm sorry, but I would never
let that happen to me.

00:07:30.234 --> 00:07:32.486
Instead, I... I woke up.

00:07:32.653 --> 00:07:35.906
Yeah, that's right. It was all a dream.

00:07:36.073 --> 00:07:38.825
You mean a nightmare. You know
you're on the ceiling, right?

00:07:39.994 --> 00:07:41.495
I will get you for this.

00:07:41.662 --> 00:07:43.455
Oh! And then the lights went out.

00:07:43.622 --> 00:07:46.708
It was horrible and sad
how Puss pleaded for mercy.

00:07:46.876 --> 00:07:48.210
Mercy? Please.

00:07:48.377 --> 00:07:50.170
Said Puss,
with his last dying breath.

00:07:50.337 --> 00:07:52.464
But when the lights came back on,

00:07:52.631 --> 00:07:54.758
it was the donkey
who was taking a shower.

00:07:54.925 --> 00:07:56.927
Oh, my goodness.
Why would I do that?

00:07:57.094 --> 00:07:59.346
And right behind you,
there was danger.

00:07:59.513 --> 00:08:01.848
- Oh, man.
- You were paralyzed.

00:08:02.516 --> 00:08:04.351
It was a donkey-eating waffle.

00:08:04.518 --> 00:08:06.978
It was packing heat
and it wanted revenge!

00:08:07.146 --> 00:08:09.690
I want revenge!

00:08:09.857 --> 00:08:11.441
The donkey... ran.

00:08:11.609 --> 00:08:13.986
But how far can you run
when you are on a plate,

00:08:14.153 --> 00:08:16.405
covered in butter, wearing a pink tutu?

00:08:16.572 --> 00:08:17.990
- No!
- And a sombrero!

00:08:18.157 --> 00:08:21.326
And a coconut brassiere!
And about to be eaten alive!

00:08:21.494 --> 00:08:24.914
No! Please!
Please, I'll switch to pancakes.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.295
And the donkey was never seen again.

00:08:34.215 --> 00:08:36.383
But what Puss didn't know
is that right behind him

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.510
was the one thing he feared more
than anything else.

00:08:38.677 --> 00:08:40.720
- No. You wouldn't.
- I would.

00:08:40.888 --> 00:08:42.139
- You didn't.
- I did.

00:08:42.306 --> 00:08:45.225
No! Anything but that! No!